{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1028.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"0326044f1d4de2dbc4e1fb465434752c6a6bf4fbd98443516ae13a60559f311a","ja":"頼れる大学生、麗花！？","zh":"可靠的大学生，丽花！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1028.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"36d218a50dbb99ece65cca55bc965d3a7ddfddb5212c40ea4ab905abd9ab0e98","ja":"わあ～っ、オシャレなカフェ……！\nここも入ってよかったんですか？","zh":"哇～，好时髦的咖啡馆……！\n这里也是可以进去的吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1028.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"3d01d75620982ef48e0979fdd7d45db9723bd8d0f82e378fb191763a40c6d20a","ja":"うん、大学の人に確認したから大丈夫だよ！\n誰でもウェルカムなんだって♪","zh":"嗯，我已经向大学里的人确认过了，所以没问题的！\n听说谁去都欢迎呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1028.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"defbfec2cd100948113ffe9d69aa88e1f794dfb40879821de913a9a0c3bbd89e","ja":"私も前に、他の大学のカフェでランチしたこと\nあったんだ♪　カレーの味が全然違ったんだよ♪","zh":"我之前也去过其他大学的咖啡厅吃午餐哦♪\n咖喱的味道完全不一样呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1028.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"466a3214749cf9ac526a3b26bcd6cbe55f78b1305ce5c1c72d0bd0b90de00782","ja":"大学って、とても開けた場所なんですね。","zh":"大学还真是个非常开放的地方呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1028.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"7c90f8cd8b2050d3a59475ef03ac908a633b5d0fc78068997f7e910a9ee0d02a","ja":"さっきお話したオペラサークルにも、\n他の大学から来た人がいましたし。","zh":"刚才提到的歌剧社团里，\n也有来自其他大学的人呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1028.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"07f1125a0c5d093399de608962477a60cc63d8c856b21c9e505f88d9c8ec2ae1","ja":"大学の垣根を越えて、みんなで頑張ってるんだね。\nすっごくきれいな歌声だったな……。","zh":"跨越了大学的界限，大家都在一起努力呢。\n歌声真的太动听了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1028.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"9e58a1995a3b3a8e92999883dca16109782e7300520f6298fc099c0b6389aed2","ja":"ええ、本当に……。\nオペラが大好きな人が集まっていて。","zh":"嗯，真的……\n聚集的都是非常喜欢歌剧的人。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1028.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"55982736e6cfaf1e824a8d1e7c4a20daffaba5248a8ce1db5315c112ca9bb41f","ja":"サークル活動って、\n好きなものを目いっぱい楽しめるんだよ♪","zh":"社团活动啊，\n就是能尽情享受自己喜欢的事物哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1028.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"fd3d028516a53851450293e31c45752757ceb003c48d465dea02e4be208ede7d","ja":"私の大学の友達にも、「ハンドベルが好きだから\nハンドベルサークル作る！」って子がいるんだ。","zh":"我大学的朋友里，也有人说\n“因为喜欢手铃，所以要建一个手铃社团！”呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1028.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"f438ee02409c07b83bfbb57949c5616f17ab6e9ea2d22846b2e34ba6a3434cdb","ja":"素敵……私たちの劇みたいな熱い場面が、\nきっといろんなサークルであるんでしょうね。","zh":"真棒……像我们的舞台剧那样精彩热血的场面，\n肯定也在各个社团里上演着吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1028.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"ed9f00471a115857733089ceaa657cfed7eb86ef65c805306c591cf77c789c43","ja":"実際に大学を見学しないと分からなかったかも……。\n麗花さん、今日はありがとうございました。","zh":"要是不亲自去大学参观一下，可能就不会明白呢……\n丽花小姐，今天真是谢谢你了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1028.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"bec123c0e066c53854d7b7bb02c31dd8fbbb93717d9c3427d5d95790fa3175e6","ja":"どういたしまして♪","zh":"不客气♪","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1028.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"39ae6f3e16c3e36fa411c4a547e63f4aa232ff1c2385e3e08e62572a1bb634f7","ja":"私は現役大学生だから、\n大学のことはなんでも聞いてね！　えっへん！","zh":"我现在可是现役大学生，\n大学的事情尽管问我吧！哼哼！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1028.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"0e17356224b58671071a189667d633f17fb9f38d66125d36b72edb4258dfbb35","ja":"はい！　ところで……そろそろ待ち合わせの時間です\nよね。ええと、『広場の噴水前』で集合でしたっけ？","zh":"好的！话说……差不多到碰头的时间了\n对吧。我想想，集合地点是“广场的喷泉前”来着？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1028.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"cbc8809c05e62079f9c3fb8bba6d276fffc4d7edcc721e35f2090a105b20f641","ja":"あ、でも、さっき広場を通った時に、\n噴水はなかったみたいですけど……？","zh":"啊，不过，刚才路过广场的时候，\n好像并没有喷水池……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1028.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"b4df10e609836ce8502e1162d780981fe92036cf87c703119ec74408e82239c1","ja":"え～っ！？　でもでも、大学で\n待ち合わせって言ったら、噴水前が定番だよ？","zh":"咦～！？可是可是，要是在大学里\n碰头的话，喷水池前是固定碰头地点吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1028.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"0cde9d8d1c80a0dd459ab98765ba9a1bc382d20e6f4c77ed74f305f5c06adfce","ja":"あの……それってもしかして、\n麗花さんの大学限定のお話なんじゃ……？","zh":"那个……这该不会只是\n丽花小姐你们大学特有的事情吧……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
